  "goodToKnow": "Die Verwarnung is an official warning or caution. For minor traffic offences, police issue a Verwarnung mit Verwarnungsgeld (up to 55 euros, no points); from 60 euros it becomes a Bußgeld. In football, the yellow card is officially eine Verwarnung. In labour law, the stronger step is die Abmahnung. Verwarnen means to caution. Plural: die Verwarnungen."
